==English==

===Verb===
'''[[put]] [[through]] [[its]] [[paces]]'''

# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To test completely; to [[exercise]] the full [[range]] of abilities or functions.
#: ''Before buying the car, we '''put it through its paces'''.''

===Usage notes===
"Paces" in this phrase is always plural.

